{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋での個別握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方、ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ハンガーゲーム見たよ。でも間違えて字幕見ちゃった。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言う人が何名かいました...ヽ(゜ω゜　)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"字幕見ても私は出演してないですよ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひみなさんも吹き替え版を見ていただけるとうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、この間乃木どこの運動会でやった「わんこそば対決」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくすごかったね〜って言われるんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはねー、余裕でした(￣ω￣)♪ハハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともと食べるのは早くて、お弁当とかもあっという間に食べれちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段みんなにも「食べっぷりいいね〜」って褒められるんです(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服はいつもと違ってラフな感じ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日言ってた「宇宙にほんのちょっとだけのっかった服」とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星模様のこの服のこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「なんだーそれのこと？」って聞かれましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ほんのちょっと」ってちゃんと書きましたよ〜。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はまた毎回変えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本のストレート→ゆる巻き→ハーフアップ→ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールは長さ的にできないと思ってたからできて感動"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんと髪型ちょくちょくかぶったのヾ(*´∀`*)ノうれしす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2012/09/30/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F14.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日もみなさんとの会話で心が明るくなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/30/3307627/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間をありがとうございましたo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}